# Daily database backup for NIEC Visa AI.
#
# Install:
#   sudo crontab -u niec -e
# then paste the line below (adjust the path if you installed elsewhere).
#
# It runs at 03:15 server time, writes a consistent copy into backups/ and
# keeps the newest 14. Output goes to logs/backup.log so a silent failure
# leaves a trace.

15 3 * * * cd /opt/niec-visa-ai && /usr/bin/node scripts/backup.mjs >> logs/backup.log 2>&1

# IMPORTANT: a backup that lives only on this server is not a backup. Copy it
# somewhere else too - another machine, object storage, anywhere off this box.
# Example, once you have an rclone remote configured:
#
# 45 3 * * * /usr/bin/rclone copy /opt/niec-visa-ai/backups niec-backups:visa-ai --max-age 48h
#
# And remember: every backup is encrypted with DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY from .env.
# Store that key somewhere separate and safe. Without it these files cannot be
# restored by anyone, including NIEC.
